WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.327
Skillora: High-Trust Student Opportunity Intelligence & Deterministic Matching Platform.
Welcome to Skillora, the high-trust student opportunity intelligence platform built on Next.js 16, React 19, and Supabase.

2
00:00:10.327 --> 00:00:19.440
Verified Sources (Google, Devpost, Unstop) with Multi-Layer SHA-256 Deduplication.
It automatically ingests and deduplicates internships, hackathons, and fellowships from Google, Devpost, and Unstop.

3
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:31.223
Deterministic Scoring: 35% Skills + 20% Track + 15% Location + 30% Urgency Decay.
Unlike black-box recommenders, Skillora provides a 100% explainable score based on skill match, category, location, and deadline urgency.

4
00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:39.760
Modern Glassmorphic Design System with Instant Dark & Light Mode Support.
The interface features rich glassmorphism styling, vibrant gradients, and instant dark and light mode transitions.

5
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:47.559
Mobile-Optimized Interface with Instant Filtering & Responsive Cards.
It is fully responsive for mobile devices, enabling students to track opportunities on the go with zero friction.

6
00:00:47.559 --> 00:00:57.731
Supabase Auth, Row Level Security, Data Export & GDPR Right-to-Erasure.
Security is enterprise-grade with PostgreSQL Row Level Security, secure auth cookies, and GDPR self-service account deletion.

7
00:00:57.731 --> 00:01:07.094
Live Demo: skillora-aditya.vercel.app | 100% Test Coverage & Open Source.
Skillora is live on Vercel with 100% passing tests. Explore the demo at skillora-aditya.vercel.app!

